OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FChance of a
OL,6,Ffew showers this evening in the south.
OL,7,FThe rest of the night will be cloudy
OL,8,Fwith rain, occasionally heavy,
OL,9,Fspreading northeast during the early
OL,10,Fhours.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA mostly cloudy day with
OL,13,Fshowers or occasionally longer spells
OL,14,Fof rain, heavy at times, Chance of
OL,15,Fthunder in the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
