OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FShowers on Monday morning, becoming
OL,7,Fdry in the afternoon. Rain spreading
OL,8,Feast on Tuesday morning followed by
OL,9,Fshowers. Further rain spreading
OL,10,Fnortheast on Wednesday.
